Package: mica-ssh
Version: 2025.89-mica1
Source-Date-Epoch: 1790638915
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Mica OS <hi@micaos.dev>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: dropbear-bin, mica-system
Description: Mica OS SSH: dropbear, disabled until micad enables it
 SSH as an option on the floor: dropbear.service, its prestart
 /usr/lib/mica/mica-dropbear-prestart and the preset that keeps the unit
 disabled. micad enables and starts it at runtime scope after writing
 /run/mica/dropbear.env; the prestart makes the ed25519 host key on the STATE
 partition at the first start. The unit requires mica-shadow-reconcile.service,
 so the shadow file is built in RAM before a login can read it.
 .
 dropbear authenticates through crypt(3) against /etc/shadow, not through PAM:
 the build refuses a pinned dropbear-bin that depends on PAM or whose binary
 names libpam. No OpenSSH.
 .
 On an OpenRC root the same service is /etc/init.d/mica-dropbear, in no
 runlevel: micad starts it the same way.
